This is a specific definition of Mind.
Mind is a simple language that can write blog.

Symbol:
   D a plain text until `\n`, includes `\n`
   U a URL until `\n`, exclusive `\n`
   N a plain text until `\n`, exclusive `\n`
   S(c) replace 1st char of `  ` into c
Base Syntax:
D a topic title
S(c)D  a related content belongs 
       nearest independent D
S(`>`)N
S(`=`)U   a link, with link text is N, 
          linked url is U. 
          this 2 lines is bounds together
S(`@`)N
S(`|`)D
S(`|`)D
...
S(`|`)D   N is the PL name,
          all D in sequence 
          is n lines (n >= 1) codes of N, 
          can be click to copy,
          will be highlight if supported,
          those lines are bound together
S(`$`)U a image, where U is image url
